","original":null}},"text":"So the reason auto collecting the chests fails so much is because at the start of a round the camera pans to the final boss and scans over the whole level, while the camera is doing this you can't collect chests. I know it's open source but I am not smart enough to fix it. If there is a way to wait an extra 15 seconds before auto collecting the chests I think It would get 5/5 every time. Currently on some maps it is only collecting 2/5 (if you cant re create this bug I suggest you try auto collecting the chests on a bigger map)","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-04-22T10:06:33.193Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"69e89eb61b59d3f523a09a67","commentBy":{"_id":"69e888b10f30768d4b467366","username":"Luckime","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lastActive":"2026-05-14T19:48:12.837Z","createdAt":"2026-04-22T08:37:05.462Z","status":"offline","id":"69e888b10f30768d4b467366","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"Also a suggestion: Is there a chance to have an auto next for the voting choices, (and if you can't go next because you failed the level then it just retries the level)","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-04-22T10:11:02.159Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"69e974670dfaab086f22fdeb","commentBy":{"_id":"698e81e93384bf4618026322","username":"Rob666","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b5b9de4edf25e302732a4b1f34ad93c9345fb87c99dfc009abe59f4e15e145af.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/698e81e93384bf4618026322-1776646233535.png"},"lastActive":"2026-06-03T23:31:52.878Z","createdAt":"2026-02-13T01:44:09.755Z","status":"offline","id":"698e81e93384bf4618026322","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b5b9de4edf25e302732a4b1f34ad93c9345